{
  "$schema": "https://www.designtokens.org/schemas/2025.10/format.json",
  "$description": "The accent themes (COL-27): one person-picked colour, in file order. `black` is the default and carries no values: it IS the semantic contract (`semantic.tokens.json` / `semantic.dark.tokens.json`), so it can never drift from it. Every other accent names five colours per mode; `link`, `unread` and the `nav-selected*` trio are derived in `accents.mjs`. The `hex` is the sRGB target the OKLCH must round to (the build fails otherwise). `primary-hover` and `primary-pressed` are real shades, one lightness step (about 0.04-0.06) each, never an opacity: a translucent fill would drop a coloured label below AA.",
